<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places Dec 2 paper $402 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places Dec 2 paper $402 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed December 2 bank liquidity paper for $402 million and 10 million pesos.</p>
<p>The paper was set at 99.1529 pesos and dollars.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
